T*
(- Immediate Dermal First Aid Protocol: Irrigate immediately with Polyethylene Glycol 300/400 \(PEG-300\) swabbing solution at Unit 2300 safety showers \(water alone is less effective at extracting phenol from dermal tissue\).) Tj
